                 'the call was successful, and — only when the conversation is short — the plain chat messages. Tool '
                 'calls, tool results, and contextual updates are omitted so the response stays small. Use this '
                 'instead of the full conversation endpoint when you only need the gist (e.g. an agent reading many '
